business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","review_id":"wzKn9h4B7ne6hkIKnqMZTw","date":"2013-06-17T16:42:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.933180570602417,"text_excerpt":"I've gone to Indulge two Sundays in a row, and I can see it quickly becoming one of my favorite weekend spots. Service is top notch. Everyone is always really nice and helpful. I'm always greeted when I walk in the door and everyone is always smiling. The atmosphere is really nice. It's kind of a classy, beachy theme. Feels a little bit like you're in Key West. Inside there is a bar and several tables. Outside, you'll find another bar, several tables under a covered patio, and of course....the pool. You pay $10 for all-day pool access. I think this is a great value. A friend told me that the pool is free on Mondays. There's a volleyball net over the pool, and it's a lot of fun when you ca..."},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","review_id":"5F0A9RuQeqoF37CC-pNMZQ","date":"2013-05-19T15:05:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9250649809837341,"text_excerpt":"So we went back yesterday to swim and have some drinks and this place has gotten its act together. Service was great, and the whole vibe was just great. We had a freaking great time hanging by the pool, playing the volleyball, and generally pretending we were on vacation. Thanks to all of the staff that was so much fun. Great times for all. Can't update the food portion of my review as I didnt really eat. I had one nacho off our plate and it was good. Nothing WOW. And not as big as most nachos are, but it was tasty. But the drinks were a blast...and like I said, the service was really welcoming and friendly. We will be back!"},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","review_id":"bAJh4C_vBQ7BIZCnT13jEg","date":"2013-04-08T13:24:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9247699975967407,"text_excerpt":"Really unique place. Inside dining & outside patio too with a pool and health club. LOVE the water. The portions could be a little bigger, but they make up with it with great happy hour specials. I think they are starting pool volleyball tournaments. The service staff is new, but trying hard to please. I had hot boiled crawfish and they were delicious. The onion soup was terrific. My husband had the happy hour fish tacos and said they were great. The chef does a really good jb, I just wanted more in each portion."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","photo_id":"g89hU1rA-wmhZXpsdYdhyQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/g89hU1rA-wmhZXpsdYdhyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8761171698570251},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","photo_id":"WVQc-e1fSdLjS5UHPYWhSQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/WVQc-e1fSdLjS5UHPYWhSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8538488149642944},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","photo_id":"LjjkbBhGwI91lG4BQYnWeg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LjjkbBhGwI91lG4BQYnWeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7995091676712036},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","photo_id":"QPdvMjrHpa5I8TwKWzelFQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QPdvMjrHpa5I8TwKWzelFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7884631156921387},{"business_id":"5J65PhaSFmOngOEQFYOVaw","photo_id":"9asFIMDu6KEnq9_qFzFTiA","label":"food","image_url